{"title":"Mammoth Ivory","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Mammoth Bull, Woolly Mammoth, Tundra Mammoth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"woolly-mammoth\" title=\"Woolly Mammoth - dropped it in 3 of 4 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/78186edb9c35b1e30627.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Woolly Mammoth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"mammoth-bull\" title=\"Mammoth Bull - dropped it in 5 of 13 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/52996b6f21954b3db198.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mammoth Bull</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"tundra-mammoth\" title=\"Tundra Mammoth - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/293398ca4f220d00900a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tundra Mammoth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"mammoth-ivory\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5b5ea269b02209827643.svg\" alt=\"Mammoth Ivory\"></div><h3>Mammoth Ivory</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n